    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this superb three-bay, three-storey over basement Georgian property, occupying a prominent corner site with dual street frontage in the heart of Limerick City Centre.\n\nThis stand out property is Ideally positioned just one block from Colbert Train and Bus Station, immediately adjacent to the city`s vibrant central business and retail district, and also within close proximity of the hugely popular People`s Park.\nThis impressive property offers an exceptional opportunity in one of Limerick`s most sought-after city centre locations.\n\nThe property boasts bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout and retains the character and appeal associated with its Georgian origins. While some refurbishment works are required, the property is presented in reasonable condition and provides an excellent blank canvas for those seeking to create a distinctive residence or investment. \n\nShould be of particular interest to developers, builders and investors offering considerable potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning and statutory approvals, with possibilities including individual letting rooms or self-contained studios or apartments. Equally, it could make a wonderful owner-occupied home for those looking to put their own stamp on a substantial period property in a highly convenient location.\n\nThis property may also qualify for applicable Limerick City inner-city incentive and/or refurbishment grant schemes, subject to eligibility and the relevant terms and conditions.\n Listed and BER exempt.\n\nWith its prominent corner position, generous accommodation, excellent transport links and significant redevelopment potential, this is a property that deserves serious consideration.\n A very attractive price point, with enormous potential. Early inspection is highly recommended. Full details available on request."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway - 5m (16'5\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\n\nLiving room - 5.9m (19'4\") x 4m (13'1\")\nFeature fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 2.4m (7'10\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\n\nShower room - 2.1m (6'11\") x 1.3m (4'3\")\nW.C. whb. Electric shower.\n\nBasement - 5.08m (16'8\") x 3.7m (12'2\")\nkitchen/room 1\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.2m (10'6\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\n\nBedroom 2 - 6m (19'8\") x 4m (13'1\")\nFeature fireplace.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.2m (10'6\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\n\nBedroom 4 - 6m (19'8\") x 4m (13'1\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
